1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:01,970
My cat just fought my landlord.

2
00:00:01,970 --> 00:00:02,500
I'm Mara.

3
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:05,450
I have two minutes, and
I'm locked in with myself.

4
00:00:06,183 --> 00:00:07,243
She locked me in.

5
00:00:07,243 --> 00:00:08,853
Then she told me why.

6
00:00:09,053 --> 00:00:10,703
One word. Lie.

7
00:00:11,113 --> 00:00:11,653
Vale lied?

8
00:00:11,653 --> 00:00:12,303
I'm shocked.

9
00:00:12,303 --> 00:00:12,463
No.

10
00:00:12,463 --> 00:00:13,003
I'm lying.

11
00:00:13,003 --> 00:00:14,173
I'm not shocked.

12
00:00:14,363 --> 00:00:16,413
She had tried his trade already.

13
00:00:16,413 --> 00:00:17,123
Last night.

14
00:00:17,123 --> 00:00:18,193
My tomorrow.

15
00:00:18,493 --> 00:00:20,173
She gave herself up for Mom.

16
00:00:20,173 --> 00:00:21,803
And he kept them both.

17
00:00:22,403 --> 00:00:25,133
It's eleven fifty
nine, Miss Reyes.

18
00:00:25,233 --> 00:00:26,873
Zip, get behind me.

19
00:00:26,973 --> 00:00:28,423
No. I was a bouncer.

20
00:00:28,623 --> 00:00:30,583
What is that cat doing?

21
00:00:30,783 --> 00:00:32,033
You're not on the list!

22
00:00:32,733 --> 00:00:35,733
He burned so bright that
Vale covered his eyes.

23
00:00:35,933 --> 00:00:37,003
The door was open.

24
00:00:37,003 --> 00:00:39,143
And only one of us could leave.

25
00:00:39,343 --> 00:00:40,573
So I picked.

26
00:00:41,373 --> 00:00:42,723
Mara! No! Mara!

27
00:00:43,523 --> 00:00:44,993
I tried to say goodbye.

28
00:00:44,993 --> 00:00:46,443
No sound came out.
